<title>YEMEN: Yemen controls blaze in Nigerian cargo jet.</title>
<headline>Yemen controls blaze in Nigerian cargo jet.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemeni rescue units on Thursday put out a fire that broke out in a Nigerian cargo plane after its back wheels exploded while it was landing at Sanaa airport, the official news agency SABA said.</p>
<p>The blaze destroyed the rear of the aircraft but no one was injured , it added. It gave no further details and did not name the Nigerian company operating the cargo service.</p>
</text>
